# SPFx Media Quality (Auto-attach)

Surface: `src/webparts/**/assets/**` (~451 files) · `SiteAssets/**` images · referenced from `*.module.scss` `background-image` / `background`, TSX `<img>`, and game markup templates.

## Sources
- No `placehold.co`, `via.placeholder.com`, `dummyimage.com`, `picsum.photos`, or broken hotlinks
- Prefer committed assets under `src/webparts/**/assets/` / `SiteAssets/` / user-approved URLs
- Confirm license before third-party images

## Quality & CLS
- Real, on-brand imagery — not vague stock filler when product/place matters
- `<img>`: explicit `width`/`height` or CSS `aspect-ratio` to prevent layout shift
- SCSS `background-image`: pair with explicit box size (`width`/`height` or `aspect-ratio`) + `background-size`/`object-fit` — never rely on intrinsic size
- Prefer WebP/optimized sizes; lazy-load below-fold (`loading="lazy"`)

## Accessibility
- Informative images: specific `alt`
- Decorative / SCSS background: empty `alt` or no `<img>` at all
- Do not put essential copy only inside an image

## Checks
- Paths resolve under this repo (`src/webparts/**/assets/`, `SiteAssets/`, relative template paths)
- Bundled asset requires wired (SPFx `require()` / `loadJson`) — not a raw site-relative path that breaks on deploy
- Mobile + desktop crop still readable
- Error/empty states must not show broken-image icons
